      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Use it in your own workflow**\n\nHashBidX boxes use ComfyUI's standard connections, so they fit between the boxes you already use.\n\n1. **Before:** any box that outputs an IMAGE can feed **first_frame**, **last_frame** or a reference. Here **Upscale Image** crops the picture to 16:9 first. A picture from your own local model connects the same way.\n2. **After:** the **video** output goes into any box that takes a VIDEO. Here the frames are enlarged 1.5 times and put back together with the sound.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\nReplace the boxes before and after with your own.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Use it in your own workflow**\n\nHashBidX boxes use ComfyUI's standard connections, so they fit between the boxes you already use.\n\n1. **Before:** any box that outputs an IMAGE can feed **first_frame**, **last_frame** or a reference. Here **Upscale Image** crops the picture to 16:9 first. A picture from your own local model connects the same way.\n2. **After:** the **video** output goes into any box that takes a VIDEO. Here the frames are enlarged 1.5 times and put back together with the sound.\n3. Press **Run**.\n\nReplace the boxes before and after with your own.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
